sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant SE as ServerErrorMiddleware (Starlette, outermost)
    participant OB as observability_middleware (yours)
    participant EX as ExceptionMiddleware (422, 404, ApiError handlers)
    participant H as /predict handler
    C->>SE: POST /predict, X-Request-ID: r1
    SE->>OB: request
    OB->>OB: request_id, in_flight += 1, start timer
    OB->>EX: call_next(request)
    EX->>H: route and validate
    alt validation fails
        EX-->>OB: 422 response
    else handler raises RuntimeError
        H--xOB: exception propagates OUT of call_next
        OB->>OB: finally: count status 500, observe latency, in_flight -= 1, access log
        OB--xSE: exception re-raised
        SE-->>C: 500 from the Exception handler (no traceback in the body)
    end
    OB->>OB: finally: count, observe, in_flight -= 1, access log
    OB-->>C: response + X-Request-ID
